# Arch family package for the gnome-extensions module (P6.3).
# dash-to-dock is AUR-only on Arch (not in any official repo as of P6.3
# research), so it is not declared here; the shared gnome-shell-extensions
# bundle ships user-theme in extra, and the curated enables stay effective
# for whatever the operator installs themselves.
gnome-shell-extensions
